# Original MIT-licensed Z80 probe for Issue #37. Placed at 0100h in a generated
# system ROM, entered by JP 0100h. DI; each pair is LD A,n / OUT (port),A.
# Mixer disables tone/noise gates; only channel A selects the envelope.
# EP=0101h, descending repeating shape 8; HALT with interrupts disabled.
f3
3e 07 d3 a0 3e 3f d3 a1
3e 08 d3 a0 3e 10 d3 a1
3e 0b d3 a0 3e 01 d3 a1
3e 0c d3 a0 3e 01 d3 a1
3e 0d d3 a0 3e 08 d3 a1
76
